{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">尖沙咀街頭有地下鹹水管爆裂，黃泥水不斷湧出，交通未受影響。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場消息稱凌晨二時許，加連威老道馬路邊地下一條約6寸直徑的鹹水管爆裂，黃泥水不斷湧出，水浸面積約30平方米。車輛駛過濺起水花，交通沒有受到影響。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST-0430_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026G36FMolqYf1786483786.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BURST-0430_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水務署人員到場閂水掣及搶修。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T21:39:20.763066+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}